[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3188055208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109606#issuecomment-3188055208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109606","id":3188055208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-Bdyo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-14T11:07:29Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T11:16:36Z","body":"You need to use the built-in type base for your class, like so:\n```gdscript\nfunc get_all() -> Array[Hero]:\n\treturn Array(party_positions.values(), TYPE_OBJECT, &\"RefCounted\", Hero)\n```\nSee the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_array.html#class-array-constructor-array) for reference\n\nThis might need to be documented better, or the check might need to be more descriptive (though it does explicitly specify it has to be a built-in class for the second to last parameter)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/g